      <b>Figure 1:</b>
      Repository metadata is created in a top-down manner: 1) a scientific context is sampled from a taxonomy, 2) an LLM generates a specific project's specification, 3) the project's directory structure and file structure are procedurally generated from the project's independent, dependent, and other variables.                    
